{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 3",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-635418409416262505 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=635418409265267561&sectionId=635418409416262505)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWi0E6lAfS_text","label":"ggWi0E6lAfS_text","default":"<p>Christmas has a way of bringing old memories back into the spotlight. Family traditions return, familiar songs fill the house, old photographs make their way through group chats, and stories that have been told for years somehow become part of the celebration again.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That makes Christmas an especially meaningful time to give something connected to a memory. Instead of searching for another item that someone may or may not use, you can start with a moment that already matters to them and turn it into something they can experience in a completely new way.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With Memobrick, a favorite photograph becomes a brick mosaic that can be assembled piece by piece. The finished artwork becomes a keepsake, while the process of building it gives the recipient another memory to add to the original one.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYfPM1SNQS_text","label":"ggYfPM1SNQS_text","default":"<p>Start With the Photograph, Not the Shopping List</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrfu9Sl95Q_text","label":"ggrfu9Sl95Q_text","default":"<p>Christmas shopping often begins by thinking about what someone needs or what product might look good under the tree. A more personal approach is to think about the moments that make that person who they are.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Look through your photographs and pay attention to the ones that immediately bring a story to mind. It might be a picture from a family trip, a childhood photograph, a favorite pet, a special celebration, or even a completely ordinary day that became memorable for reasons only your family understands.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That photograph can become the foundation of the gift. Instead of choosing an item first and trying to make it personal afterward, you are starting with something that already has meaning.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIyFqM9oJN_text","label":"ggIyFqM9oJN_text","default":"<p>Turn a Favorite Photograph Into a Christmas Activity</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrNCTIcwED_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggrNCTIcwED_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/9e1ffdbf-5bda-4e6e-a604-1bf263333ce4.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrNCTIcwED_alt","label":"ggrNCTIcwED_alt","default":"Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrNCTIcwED_title","label":"ggrNCTIcwED_title","default":"Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8DZ8toEDb_text","label":"gg8DZ8toEDb_text","default":"<p>One of the things that makes a Memobrick different from an ordinary personalized gift is that the recipient can become part of the process.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Once the box is opened, the photograph does not simply appear as a finished piece. The mosaic has to be assembled, giving the recipient an opportunity to watch the image develop gradually.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The first section might look like a collection of colorful bricks. As more pieces are added, familiar shapes begin to appear. Eventually, the photograph becomes recognizable, creating that satisfying moment when everything starts to come together.</p><p>During the Christmas season, this can turn into something the whole family enjoys. The building can happen over an afternoon, during a quiet evening, or whenever everyone has time to sit down together.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjBxHO5SWu_text","label":"ggjBxHO5SWu_text","default":"<p>Give Them Something They Can Discover</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAGDP2-GP1_text","label":"ggAGDP2-GP1_text","default":"<p>A good Christmas gift can create excitement before it is even opened. A Memobrick can add another layer because the recipient may recognize the photograph while still being surprised by how it looks as a mosaic.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is particularly fun when the chosen image is something they know extremely well. A favorite family photograph might suddenly look completely different when represented by hundreds of small bricks. A beloved pet can become a colorful mosaic. A favorite vehicle can take on a new character as wall art.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The experience is not simply about seeing the finished image. It is about watching something familiar become unfamiliar and then gradually recognizable again.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1c7mTehVp_text","label":"gg1c7mTehVp_text","default":"<p>Christmas Memories Do Not Have to Be Perfect</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDK6HVsEDN_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggDK6HVsEDN_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/ae919292-3a15-4bfb-81cf-f1086ddf7525.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDK6HVsEDN_alt","label":"ggDK6HVsEDN_alt","default":"Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDK6HVsEDN_title","label":"ggDK6HVsEDN_title","default":"Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0benTyPyh_text","label":"gg0benTyPyh_text","default":"<p>Some of the best Christmas photographs are not carefully planned.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Someone might be laughing in the background. A child might be caught making a funny face. The family dog may have decided to join the photograph at the worst possible moment. The decorations might be slightly messy and the lighting might not be perfect.</p><p>Those details are often what make the photograph worth remembering.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When choosing an image for a Memobrick, do not automatically reject a photograph because it is not perfectly posed. If the image brings back a story or makes the recipient smile, that personal connection can matter much more than photographic perfection.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBCdXdQM3Z_text","label":"ggBCdXdQM3Z_text","default":"<p>Find the Christmas Story Hidden in Your Camera Roll</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiNyLORU8e_text","label":"ggiNyLORU8e_text","default":"<p>Your camera roll might contain more gift ideas than you realize.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Look beyond the obvious holiday photographs. You might find a picture from a summer vacation that the family still talks about, an old photograph of the children, a picture of grandparents from years ago, or a funny snapshot that represents a friendship.</p><p>The best choice may be a photograph that has nothing to do with Christmas itself.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Christmas is simply the occasion for giving it.</p><p>That can make the gift feel more personal because the focus is not on the holiday trend of the year. It is on the person receiving it and the memory you chose specifically for them.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaTg8Ix0RI_text","label":"ggaTg8Ix0RI_text","default":"<p>Make the Gift About Their Interests</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUpBU5DeWk_text","label":"ggUpBU5DeWk_text","default":"<p>A personalized Christmas gift can also reflect what someone genuinely loves.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For the car enthusiast, a favorite vehicle can become a detailed brick mosaic. Motorcycle riders can choose a photograph from an unforgettable ride or a bike they have spent years caring for. Travelers can recreate a destination that means something to them. Pet lovers can turn a favorite companion into a piece of artwork.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This flexibility means you do not have to force every Christmas gift into the same idea. The photograph can be chosen around the recipient's personality, making each Memobrick different from the next.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For cars and motorcycles, consider larger sizes such as <strong>30x20 or 40x30</strong> when the photograph contains important details. More space can help the vehicle's recognizable features stand out in the finished mosaic.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVA9dP6nTN_text","label":"ggVA9dP6nTN_text","default":"<p>A Gift the Family Can Work On Together</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggv52xfEl_s_text","label":"ggv52xfEl_s_text","default":"<p>Not every Christmas activity needs a screen.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A Memobrick can give everyone something physical to work on while conversations happen naturally around the table. Parents can help children find pieces, siblings can compete to finish sections, and grandparents can share stories about the photograph being recreated.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The finished mosaic can then become a reminder of the time everyone spent making it.</p><p>That gives the gift two stories. There is the story captured in the original photograph, and there is the story of creating the Memobrick together.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEk5NJ16_O_text","label":"ggEk5NJ16_O_text","default":"<p>When the Finished Piece Finds Its Place</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMOl7lweXE_text","label":"ggMOl7lweXE_text","default":"<p>After the final brick is placed, the project can become part of the home.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A family photograph might look at home in the living room. A travel image could add personality to an office. A pet portrait could have a special place near their favorite chair. A vehicle themed mosaic might fit naturally into a garage or hobby space.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The important thing is that the finished piece does not have to disappear into storage after Christmas. It can remain visible long after the decorations are packed away.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVb7uSJyub_text","label":"ggVb7uSJyub_text","default":"<p>Choosing the Right Size</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1_OQN1sBH_text","label":"gg1_OQN1sBH_text","default":"<p>The photograph itself can help determine which Memobrick size is appropriate. Images with one main subject and fewer details may work well in smaller formats, while photographs containing several people, pets, vehicles, or intricate backgrounds can benefit from a larger format.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you are choosing a photograph of a car or motorcycle, a size such as 30x20 or 40x30 can provide additional space for recognizable details.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Think about both the photograph and where the finished piece will be displayed. A size that gives the important parts of the image enough room can make the final result more enjoyable to build and display.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4bo7E_vxp_text","label":"gg4bo7E_vxp_text","default":"<p>Created With Human Attention</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMeu5CyRfm_text","label":"ggMeu5CyRfm_text","default":"<p>The photograph is personal, so the process of turning it into a Memobrick deserves careful attention.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>At Memobrick, technology can assist us during the creative process, but people review and refine the result. We check for mistakes, make adjustments when necessary, and pay attention to details that help the finished mosaic represent the customer's photograph as well as possible.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Every photograph is different. Some contain complex backgrounds, others have several subjects, and some require more attention to make important features work well as a brick mosaic.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Technology helps us create it. People make sure we get it right.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That combination helps us create a product that feels personal from the photograph you choose to the finished piece you receive.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggn2HNBrJ2t_text","label":"ggn2HNBrJ2t_text","default":"<p>Christmas Is About More Than What Is Under the Tree</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVJfMi7j7g_text","label":"ggVJfMi7j7g_text","default":"<p>The holiday season gives us an opportunity to spend time with the people who matter. A meaningful gift can become part of that time rather than simply being another object exchanged on Christmas morning.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A Memobrick gives you a chance to take a photograph that already has meaning and turn it into an activity, a conversation, and eventually a keepsake.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The original photograph preserves one moment. Building the mosaic can create another.</p><p>That is what makes the idea of a memory you can build so fitting for Christmas. You are not replacing an old memory with something new. You are giving that memory another chapter.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEoX4GWeEB_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggEoX4GWeEB_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/John_R._It_was_a_fun_relaxing_task._My_wife_and_I_are_thrilled_to_have_our_wedding_photo_in_such_an_interesting_style.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEoX4GWeEB_alt","label":"ggEoX4GWeEB_alt","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEoX4GWeEB_title","label":"ggEoX4GWeEB_title","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggii5080P9G_text","label":"ggii5080P9G_text","default":"<p><strong>John R.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglcGgYBoAb_text","label":"gglcGgYBoAb_text","default":"<p>&nbsp;It was a fun relaxing task. My wife and I are thrilled to have our wedding photo in such an interesting style</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggr3vAGbYwy_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggr3vAGbYwy_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Aaryn_C._So_easy_to_understand_and_a_nice_relaxing_project_for_my_free_time._Can_t_wait_to_do_another_one.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggr3vAGbYwy_alt","label":"ggr3vAGbYwy_alt","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggr3vAGbYwy_title","label":"ggr3vAGbYwy_title","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjBA9EPd6S_text","label":"ggjBA9EPd6S_text","default":"<p><strong>Aaryn C.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpWaWSEt8h_text","label":"ggpWaWSEt8h_text","default":"<p>So easy to understand and a nice relaxing project for my free time. Can't wait to do another one!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggL5y_Oy0ur_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggL5y_Oy0ur_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Candice_L._I_split_the_photo_in_half_so_I_could_get_2_of_the_60x20_so_I_could_fill_my_wall_more_and_its_turned_out_AMAZING.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggL5y_Oy0ur_alt","label":"ggL5y_Oy0ur_alt","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggL5y_Oy0ur_title","label":"ggL5y_Oy0ur_title","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUZSTpM54b_text","label":"ggUZSTpM54b_text","default":"<p><strong>Candice L.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggl5uJy7tO1_text","label":"ggl5uJy7tO1_text","default":"<p>I split the photo in half so I could get 2 of the 60x20 so I could fill my wall more and its turned out AMAZING!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2qLRyhJkY_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg2qLRyhJkY_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Jennifer_H._Was_a_fun_and_a_little_bit_challenging_project_to_do._Can_t_wait_to_do_another_one.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2qLRyhJkY_alt","label":"gg2qLRyhJkY_alt","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2qLRyhJkY_title","label":"gg2qLRyhJkY_title","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYWvnOapW__text","label":"ggYWvnOapW__text","default":"<p><strong>Jennifer H.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggzklAIw_Bj_text","label":"ggzklAIw_Bj_text","default":"<p>Was a fun and a little bit challenging project to do. Can’t wait to do another one</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGLsWep69k_viewMoreText","label":"ggGLsWep69k_viewMoreText","default":"Show more"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGLsWep69k_viewLessText","label":"ggGLsWep69k_viewLessText","default":"Show less"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfANevM9o0_text","label":"ggfANevM9o0_text","default":"Quantity"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwzJU_vt4g_label","label":"ggwzJU_